    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear that, but what about the people who feel like they're being forced to adopt a certain way of speaking that doesn't feel natural to them? some employees are worried it's more about political correctness than actual productivity. wouldnt forcing this kind of language be seen as alienating to more traditional or religious staff?",
